      "text": "Azure Cache for\nRedis\n(Rate Limit State)\nTier: Premium P4\n(managed PaaS)\nNOT on VMs —\ndedicated HW\n6 shards x 53GB =\n318GB\nPort: 6380 (TLS\nrequired)\nProtocol: RESP3\nLua: EVALSHA\natomic\nDECR+EXPIRE",
