      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "g_redis",
      "originalText": "Azure Cache for Redis\n(Rate Limit State)\nTier: Premium P4 (managed PaaS)\nNOT on VMs — dedicated HW\n6 shards x 53GB = 318GB\nPort: 6380 (TLS required)\nProtocol: RESP3\nLua: EVALSHA atomic DECR+EXPIRE",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T06:47:52.869Z",
