      "text": "Retry + Fallback (Polly\n.NET)\nDeploy: in-process\nmiddleware\nBackoff: 2s/4s/8s (exp)\nJitter: ±25% random\nFallback: GPT-4→GPT-\n3.5\nCircuit: open after 5\nfail/30s",
