      "originalText": "Retry + Fallback (Polly .NET)\nDeploy: in-process middleware\nBackoff: 2s/4s/8s (exp)\nJitter: ±25% random\nFallback: GPT-4→GPT-3.5\nCircuit: open after 5 fail/30s",
