      "versionNonce": 47885131,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784357061924,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RAI Pre-Filter (Input\nSafety)\nDeploy: AKS Pod (CPU)\n20 replicas/region\n• Prompt injection\nclassifier\n• Jailbreak ensemble (3\nmodels)\n• PII detection (Presidio)\nLatency: < 80ms",
