      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "i_rai_pre",
      "originalText": "RAI Pre-Filter (Input Safety)\nDeploy: AKS Pod (CPU)\n20 replicas/region\n• Prompt injection classifier\n• Jailbreak ensemble (3 models)\n• PII detection (Presidio)\nLatency: < 80ms",
