      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784357017807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RAI Post-Filter (Output\nSafety)\nDeploy: AKS Pod (CPU), 20\nreplicas\n• Toxicity (4-cat, 0-6\nscale)\n• Groundedness (NLI\nmodel)\n• Bias detection\nLatency: < 70ms (parallel to\nstream)",
