      "updated": 1784357035907,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Azure AI Search\n(Hybrid Index)\nDeploy: Managed\nPaaS (S3 tier)\n12 replicas, 3\npartitions\nBM25 + HNSW\n(cosine)\nSemantic ranker\nbuilt-in\n50M\ndocs/partition |\nP95 < 100ms",
