      "text": "Microsoft Graph API\nDeploy: Microsoft Global PaaS\nHTTPS REST + OData\nAuth: Bearer (delegated)\nThrottle: 10K req/10s/app\nBatch: POST /$batch\n(20/batch)\nDelta: GET /delta\n(incremental)\nWebhooks: change\nnotifications",
