      "index": "b3H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 571168555,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 158341765,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784356348857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FR: (1) Contextual M365-grounded responses (2) Multi-turn chat, 7d memory (3) Inline citations [1][2] (4) Zero cross-tenant leak (5) Plugins (WASM) (6) SSE streaming (7) Multi-modal (8) Action execution\nNFR: (1) 99.99% avail (52min/yr) (2) P50<2s P95<5s P99<8s (3) First token<800ms (4) 52K RPS peak global (5) EU data residency (6) SOC2/ISO27001/FedRAMP (7) RPO=0 RTO<5m (8) Zero-trust mTLS (9) Linear cost",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FR: (1) Contextual M365-grounded responses (2) Multi-turn chat, 7d memory (3) Inline citations [1][2] (4) Zero cross-tenant leak (5) Plugins (WASM) (6) SSE streaming (7) Multi-modal (8) Action execution\nNFR: (1) 99.99% avail (52min/yr) (2) P50<2s P95<5s P99<8s (3) First token<800ms (4) 52K RPS peak global (5) EU data residency (6) SOC2/ISO27001/FedRAMP (7) RPO=0 RTO<5m (8) Zero-trust mTLS (9) Linear cost",
