    {
      "id": "ann_math",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2920,
      "width": 1068.12890625,
      "height": 27.599999999999998,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1482245381,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 421035083,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784356348857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SCALE MATH: DAU=100M | 15 req/user/day = 1.5B/day | Peak=52K RPS | 10K tok/req = 15T tok/day | GPU raw=86.7K A100 → speculative(2.3x)+cache(40%)+fallback(30%) = 3,200/region\nRedis: 52K×60%miss×300sTTL = 9.36M entries×16KB = 150GB (in 318GB cluster) | Cosmos: 52K×10RU = 520K RU/s peak → autoscale 1M | Revenue: $30/user/mo×100M = $3B/mo > $90M/day cost",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SCALE MATH: DAU=100M | 15 req/user/day = 1.5B/day | Peak=52K RPS | 10K tok/req = 15T tok/day | GPU raw=86.7K A100 → speculative(2.3x)+cache(40%)+fallback(30%) = 3,200/region\nRedis: 52K×60%miss×300sTTL = 9.36M entries×16KB = 150GB (in 318GB cluster) | Cosmos: 52K×10RU = 520K RU/s peak → autoscale 1M | Revenue: $30/user/mo×100M = $3B/mo > $90M/day cost",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T06:47:52.870Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
      "syncTimestamp": "2026-07-18T06:47:52.861Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "ann_trade",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2970,
      "width": 714.43603515625,
      "height": 101.19999999999999,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1754085835,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2146730469,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784356348857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TRADE-OFFS:\n1. Redis: Enterprise PaaS (NOT VMs) — $3.07/hr managed vs $1.80/hr VMs+2 FTEs ($400K/yr). Net: PaaS cheaper, 99.999% SLA, zero patching\n2. Semantic Cache TTL=5min — 40% hit saves $60M/day fresh | vs 65% hit at 30min but 8% stale (120M wrong/day). Enterprise trust > savings\n3. HNSW(M=16) vs IVF-PQ — recall@10: 0.97 vs 0.89. 8% gap = 12% satisfaction lift (A/B). +$15M/yr memory justified by NPS+8\n4. Cosmos Session vs Strong — 5ms/100K RU vs 12ms/400K RU. $57.6K vs $230K/mo. Session = read-your-writes sufficient for chat\n5. SSE vs full response — first token 800ms vs 4s. Abandon 3% vs 18% (A/B). 15% less churn = $450M/yr retained\n6. Service Bus vs Kafka — SB: $0.80/hr + managed DLQ | Kafka: $0.35/hr + 3 FTEs ($600K/yr). Net: SB cheaper operationally\n7. Logical vs Physical tenant isolation — $0.003 vs $0.45/user/mo (150x). Security gap covered by encryption+RBAC+audit",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TRADE-OFFS:\n1. Redis: Enterprise PaaS (NOT VMs) — $3.07/hr managed vs $1.80/hr VMs+2 FTEs ($400K/yr). Net: PaaS cheaper, 99.999% SLA, zero patching\n2. Semantic Cache TTL=5min — 40% hit saves $60M/day fresh | vs 65% hit at 30min but 8% stale (120M wrong/day). Enterprise trust > savings\n3. HNSW(M=16) vs IVF-PQ — recall@10: 0.97 vs 0.89. 8% gap = 12% satisfaction lift (A/B). +$15M/yr memory justified by NPS+8\n4. Cosmos Session vs Strong — 5ms/100K RU vs 12ms/400K RU. $57.6K vs $230K/mo. Session = read-your-writes sufficient for chat\n5. SSE vs full response — first token 800ms vs 4s. Abandon 3% vs 18% (A/B). 15% less churn = $450M/yr retained\n6. Service Bus vs Kafka — SB: $0.80/hr + managed DLQ | Kafka: $0.35/hr + 3 FTEs ($600K/yr). Net: SB cheaper operationally\n7. Logical vs Physical tenant isolation — $0.003 vs $0.45/user/mo (150x). Security gap covered by encryption+RBAC+audit",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T06:47:52.870Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
      "syncTimestamp": "2026-07-18T06:47:52.861Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "ann_corner",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 3200,
      "width": 577.17236328125,
      "height": 101.19999999999999,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 492067941,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 150518507,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784356348858,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CORNER CASES:\nCC-1: Token overflow (>128K) → Priority eviction then MapReduce split (3% of requests)\nCC-2: Cross-tenant KV-cache leak → Tenant-scoped partitions + GPU memory wipe between batches + canary tokens\nCC-3: Stale index → Graph webhook → priority re-embed (SLA 15min), fallback to live Graph fetch\nCC-4: Prompt injection in shared docs → Spotlighting delimiters + 3-classifier ensemble (86% reduction)\nCC-5: GPU region failure → Traffic Manager failover <30s, each region at 150% capacity, degrade to GPT-3.5\nCC-6: Graph API 429 → Redis pre-fetch cache (70% hit reduces 52K/s to 15.6K/s)\nCC-7: Large files (50MB+) → Lazy chunking (only referenced sheets), async full-embed with notification",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CORNER CASES:\nCC-1: Token overflow (>128K) → Priority eviction then MapReduce split (3% of requests)\nCC-2: Cross-tenant KV-cache leak → Tenant-scoped partitions + GPU memory wipe between batches + canary tokens\nCC-3: Stale index → Graph webhook → priority re-embed (SLA 15min), fallback to live Graph fetch\nCC-4: Prompt injection in shared docs → Spotlighting delimiters + 3-classifier ensemble (86% reduction)\nCC-5: GPU region failure → Traffic Manager failover <30s, each region at 150% capacity, degrade to GPT-3.5\nCC-6: Graph API 429 → Redis pre-fetch cache (70% hit reduces 52K/s to 15.6K/s)\nCC-7: Large files (50MB+) → Lazy chunking (only referenced sheets), async full-embed with notification",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T06:47:52.870Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
      "syncTimestamp": "2026-07-18T06:47:52.861Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "ann_innov",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 3440,
      "width": 862.1142578125,
      "height": 75.89999999999999,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1442433131,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 741670213,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784356348858,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "INNOVATIONS:\n1. Semantic Kernel Planner: DAG-based multi-step planning (not simple prompt→response). Self-healing re-plan. Token budget-aware (stops at 80%)\n2. Graph Semantic Index: Pre-computed embeddings for ALL M365 content. Incremental delta updates (not full re-index). Permission-aware ACL vectors. Embedding inheritance\n3. Spotlighting: XML delimiter injection marks user data vs system instructions. 3-layer defense: Input filter → Metaprompt → Output filter. 86% indirect injection reduction\n4. Speculative Decoding + KV-Cache Sharing: Draft (GPT-3.5) generates 4 tokens, verifier (GPT-4) accepts/rejects in 1 pass = 2.3x speed. Prefix caching = 40% compute save\n5. Adaptive Token Budget: Dynamic allocation system(10%)+ground(60%)+history(20%)+output(10%). Attention-weighted pruning on first forward pass",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "INNOVATIONS:\n1. Semantic Kernel Planner: DAG-based multi-step planning (not simple prompt→response). Self-healing re-plan. Token budget-aware (stops at 80%)\n2. Graph Semantic Index: Pre-computed embeddings for ALL M365 content. Incremental delta updates (not full re-index). Permission-aware ACL vectors. Embedding inheritance\n3. Spotlighting: XML delimiter injection marks user data vs system instructions. 3-layer defense: Input filter → Metaprompt → Output filter. 86% indirect injection reduction\n4. Speculative Decoding + KV-Cache Sharing: Draft (GPT-3.5) generates 4 tokens, verifier (GPT-4) accepts/rejects in 1 pass = 2.3x speed. Prefix caching = 40% compute save\n5. Adaptive Token Budget: Dynamic allocation system(10%)+ground(60%)+history(20%)+output(10%). Attention-weighted pruning on first forward pass",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "syncedAt": "2026-07-18T06:47:52.870Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
      "syncTimestamp": "2026-07-18T06:47:52.861Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "ann_lifecycle",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 3670,
      "width": 1877.1220703125,
      "height": 12.649999999999999,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
