      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784356348858,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "E2E LIFECYCLE: T+0ms Client→T+5ms Front Door→T+10ms Rate Limit(Redis)→T+15ms Auth(JWT)→T+20ms Router→T+25ms Cache lookup | HIT@40%→done T+50ms | MISS→T+50ms Graph+Index(parallel)→T+350ms Re-rank→T+420ms RAI pre→T+450ms AOAI→T+800ms FIRST TOKEN→T+4000ms final→T+4100ms cite→T+4200ms done | P50=2.1s P95=4.8s P99=7.2s",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "E2E LIFECYCLE: T+0ms Client→T+5ms Front Door→T+10ms Rate Limit(Redis)→T+15ms Auth(JWT)→T+20ms Router→T+25ms Cache lookup | HIT@40%→done T+50ms | MISS→T+50ms Graph+Index(parallel)→T+350ms Re-rank→T+420ms RAI pre→T+450ms AOAI→T+800ms FIRST TOKEN→T+4000ms final→T+4100ms cite→T+4200ms done | P50=2.1s P95=4.8s P99=7.2s",
